acceptance_criteria: "A timed-out npm update lookup reports a distinct stable code (no npm command, stderr or environment in the output) and the diagnostic names the budget; the extension-diagnostic-purity integration test no longer depends on a cold Windows npm start finishing inside 10 s; unit tests cover the timeout and failure classifications"
parent: pm-doxj
